    "parent_id": "f6340feb-ffc0-4afc-96df-ee0a1b70452e",
    "content": "- **Dental Benefits:** 100% coverage for routine preventive cleanings (2 per year). 80% coverage for minor restorative procedures up to an annual maximum of $2,000 USD per covered individual. Orthodontia is covered at 50% with a lifetime maximum of $3,000 USD.",
